al_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/530075/5300750313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_SELAN_2011_2012_18102012054444.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Antelopus Selan Energy Limited released its Q2 FY27 investor presentation highlighting operational updates across its onshore and offshore portfolio, including production numbers, drilling progress, and financial performance. Management outlined growth plans targeting an onshore portfolio of 5,000+ boepd by FY29 alongside continuous capex cycles in the Cambay Basin. The company reported Q2 sales volumes of 1,656 boepd and detailed progress on assets such as Bakrol, Karjisan, and KG Onland. Additionally, the firm received a cess refund of approximately ₹6.5 Cr for FY21-FY23 during the quarter. Antelopus Selan Energy Limited reported its Q1 FY27 financial and operational performance, highlighting strong commodity pricing and continuous drilling execution ahead of schedule.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company is on track for a 2,500 boepd exit.","quote":"Key takeaways: On track for a 2,500 boepd exit","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"Management set a road map to achieve 2,500+ boepd in FY27.","quote":"We begin our FY 27 with a base of 1800+ boepd with a road map to 2500+ boepd in FY ‘27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The company experienced volume-driven growth despite a challenging pricing environment.","quote":"Volume-driven growth despite a challenging pricing environment","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"htt