.5 Cr. (c. +14%) & EBITDA margin at 59% ; Profit After Tax at INR 89.6Cr,up(c.+27%);","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Current production at Bakrol stands at 950+ boepd.","quote":"Current production: 950+ boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"Q2 sales volumes were reported at 1,656 boepd.","quote":"Q2 Sales Volumes: 1656 boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"October production reached 1,950 boepd.","quote":"October Production: 1950 boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"Average sales grew from 1,193 boepd to 1,355 boepd, with meaningful impact felt from Q3 FY26 onwards.","quote":"Average sales grew from 1,193 boepd to 1,355 boepd, with the meaningful impact felt from Q3 FY’26 onwards as new wells were progressively commissioned","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"},{"claim":"Q4 FY26 average sales reached approximately 1,760 boepd.","quote":"Q4 FY’26 Average sales: c.1760 boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The Commissioner (Appeals) allowed the company's refund claim for excess cess paid in FY21 to FY23 of approximately 6.56 Cr rupees.","quote":"Commissioner (Appeals) allowed the Company's refund claim for excess Cess paid in FY21–FY23, of c. ₹6.